  "instructions": "Every tool except brake_budget is charged against a hard dollar cap. When a tool answers with STOP, do not retry and do not switch to another tool: the same caps apply to all of them. Tell the user and ask them to raise the cap. A call that timed out may already have been forwarded and charged: check brake_budget before calling again. Prefer the named search and maps tools over brake_call; their defaults are the cheap SKUs, and a wider field mask or a deeper search costs more.",
